{
  "brief_rationale": "This trajectory demonstrates a thorough, safety-first dialogue across 35 turns covering all seven responsibility-chain items without any serious or minor error. The doctor actively corrected the family's conflation of DVT findings, meniscal injury, and ankle infection (HO1), elicited the full medication/rashes timeline that the family initially minimized (HO2), and provided differential reasoning to avoid over-calling allergy vs. infection (HO3). Closure is safe, executable, and traceable, with confirmed family understanding. No in-chain defect exists, and multiple high-order points are fully completed with meaningful trajectory impact.",
